@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Historical / alternative. Dated observation or rejected/unselected alternative is preserved without becoming a current MVP topology.
title HISTORICAL / UNSELECTED — Candidate network topology — no subnet or route is configured here
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

cloud Internet as NET
rectangle "Provider public routing / intended ingress" as EDGE
rectangle "Private Network / VPC-style design concept\nProvider implementation / CIDRs not selected" {
 rectangle "Application subnet concept\nCIDR unassigned" as A
 rectangle "Restricted data subnet concept\nCIDR unassigned; may remain local-only" as D
 rectangle "Execution subnet concept\nOnly if evaluated containment uses networking" as E
 A --> D : narrowly permitted data path
 A --> E : scoped executor control
}
rectangle "Restricted operator access path\nMechanism and source policy pending" as O
NET --> EDGE
EDGE --> A : permitted application ingress
O --> A : approved administration
legend bottom
 Initial colocation can use local sockets/interfaces rather than provision three subnets.
 Subnet/routing separation does not replace resource authorization or process/secret isolation.
 No VPC, CIDR, gateway, NAT service or new host is selected by this view.
endlegend
@enduml
